WEBVTT

01:01.680 --> 01:06.060
<i><b>Vampire Hunter</b></i>

01:07.230 --> 01:11.820
Kobe

01:25.870 --> 01:28.010
<b>Where's Deacon Frost?</b>

01:31.670 --> 01:33.310
<b>The Philippines.</b>

01:45.730 --> 01:48.120
<b>It's been a long time, Eric.</b>

01:48.350 --> 01:50.020
<b>You seem a bit out of practice.</b>

01:50.020 --> 01:52.020
<b>How have you been?</b>

01:53.150 --> 01:55.220
<b><i>He hasn't changed at all.</i></b>

01:56.070 --> 01:59.950
<b><i>If anything, he's gotten
livelier with old age.</i></b>

02:03.620 --> 02:06.120
<b>You doing alright, Razor?</b>

02:06.120 --> 02:09.580
<b>Hey Noah, I apologize for
calling you out of the blue like this.</b>

02:09.580 --> 02:14.670
<b>Now, Eric, you know I'm always
available to resupply you.</b>

02:14.670 --> 02:18.050
<b>If it was necessary, I'd even bring you
a couple of AAA batteries.</b>

02:24.390 --> 02:27.390
<b>Welcome to The Victoria II.</b>

02:27.390 --> 02:28.940
<b>I'm your captain, McLay.</b>

02:29.480 --> 02:34.690
<b>Just so you know, I expect you to abide
my rules while you're on this boat.</b>

02:34.690 --> 02:38.320
<b>Rule Number One: No women.</b>

02:46.290 --> 02:48.910
<b>Noah, did you bring it?</b>

02:50.500 --> 02:51.460
<b>Yes.</b>

02:51.460 --> 02:52.840
<b>It's inside.</b>

02:55.670 --> 02:56.260
<b>Hold it!</b>

02:59.720 --> 03:00.260
<b>Hey...</b>

03:03.470 --> 03:04.600
<b>You little bitch!</b>

03:06.560 --> 03:08.060
<b>Stay out of my way!</b>

03:08.770 --> 03:12.270
<b>You seem quite capable, young lady.</b>

03:12.270 --> 03:13.940
<b>I'll be your next opponent.</b>

03:30.500 --> 03:32.120
<b>Not quite there yet.</b>

03:32.120 --> 03:34.520
<b>I'd suggest you train harder
and try again.</b>

03:40.590 --> 03:43.930
<b>I've never seen Razor take a liking
to someone so quickly.</b>

03:44.430 --> 03:47.220
<b>My name is Noah Van Helsing.</b>

03:47.220 --> 03:50.980
<b>I come from a long line
of vampire hunters.</b>

03:50.980 --> 03:53.100
<b>Take her off board already.</b>

03:53.100 --> 03:54.810
<b>Women cause all kinds of problems.</b>

03:56.150 --> 03:57.320
<b>Miss...</b>

03:57.320 --> 03:58.690
<b>or rather, young man.</b>

03:59.900 --> 04:01.780
<b>How much money
do you have on you?</b>

04:05.320 --> 04:06.950
<b>I'm afraid you're mistaken.</b>

04:06.950 --> 04:08.410
<b>This is a boy, not a woman.</b>

04:08.410 --> 04:09.540
<b>Isn't that right, Captain?</b>

04:11.830 --> 04:13.670
<b>Well, in that case...</b>

04:38.440 --> 04:40.030
<b>Noah, do it.</b>

04:44.030 --> 04:46.660
<b>This is the newest version
of the retro-virus.</b>

04:46.660 --> 04:49.540
<b>Its effects should last longer
than before, but...</b>

04:49.540 --> 04:53.410
<b>I'm not sure if it's a good idea
to take it when you're hurt this badly.</b>

04:53.830 --> 04:55.000
<b>I don't care...</b>

04:55.000 --> 04:58.840
<b>this is what it takes to
keep it under control.</b>

05:47.090 --> 05:47.890
<b>Don't!</b>

05:48.890 --> 05:50.490
<b>Stay the fuck away from me!</b>

05:52.810 --> 05:54.200
<b>Miss.</b>

05:56.890 --> 05:59.610
<b>Don't you find sneak attacks
to be rather uncouth?</b>

06:00.770 --> 06:02.940
<b>Let him get some rest.</b>

06:04.360 --> 06:04.900
<b>Agreed?</b>

06:08.240 --> 06:10.340
<b>He's a Daywalker.</b>

06:10.340 --> 06:12.700
<b>Half human, half one of them.</b>

06:12.700 --> 06:15.750
<b>He uses medicine to keep his
vampiric tendencies in check, but...</b>

06:16.290 --> 06:20.750
<b>It's a harsh price to pay to live
the way any other man could.</b>

06:21.340 --> 06:21.930
<b>Here.</b>

06:23.210 --> 06:24.230
<b>Don't want any.</b>

06:30.090 --> 06:35.060
<b>I met him on a night with
a red moon, like tonight...</b>

06:36.980 --> 06:41.650
Dover, England

06:49.780 --> 06:51.450
<b>I'm sorry...</b>

06:51.450 --> 06:54.490
<b>but I can't die yet...</b>

07:22.310 --> 07:24.440
<b>There's a lovely moon out tonight.</b>

07:25.150 --> 07:31.530
<b>Woman, you should be honored to have
been chosen by nobility such as myself.</b>

07:36.030 --> 07:36.950
<b>Take her.</b>

08:09.070 --> 08:10.150
<b>Wait...</b>

08:10.150 --> 08:11.780
<b>you, aren't you our kinsman?</b>

08:11.820 --> 08:12.990
<b>No!</b>

08:12.990 --> 08:14.570
<b>I'm not like you!</b>

08:15.450 --> 08:17.280
<b>I'm human!</b>

08:17.280 --> 08:19.640
<b>Well, how fascinating...</b>

08:20.080 --> 08:25.210
<b>I've lived a long time, but I've never
seen anything like this before.</b>

08:26.040 --> 08:27.210
<b>Wait...</b>

08:27.210 --> 08:29.150
<b>could it be...</b>

08:29.510 --> 08:30.590
<b>A hybrid?</b>

08:30.590 --> 08:31.590
<b>Is that it?</b>

08:33.340 --> 08:34.220
<b>Good day.</b>

08:34.220 --> 08:36.530
<b>You're Baron Howard, right?</b>

08:36.530 --> 08:38.280
<b>Who are you!?</b>

08:38.350 --> 08:40.350
<b>I happen to be a professional...</b>

08:40.350 --> 08:43.190
<b>or rather,
a vampire hunter by blood.</b>

08:43.190 --> 08:44.690
<b>What?</b>

08:44.690 --> 08:47.310
<b>You should be able to
get plenty of rest.</b>

08:47.310 --> 08:49.820
<b>Good night, you self-styled noble rat.</b>

09:15.720 --> 09:18.050
<b>Hey, are you okay?</b>

09:18.050 --> 09:19.280
<b>Are you hurt?</b>

09:20.390 --> 09:22.220
<b>No.</b>

09:22.220 --> 09:23.020
<b>Okay...</b>

09:23.020 --> 09:24.430
<b>that's good.</b>

09:24.430 --> 09:25.520
<b>Thank you.</b>

09:27.730 --> 09:28.810
<b>Monster!</b>

09:29.020 --> 09:30.110
<b>No!</b>

09:35.780 --> 09:37.660
<b>Monster, eh?</b>

09:37.660 --> 09:38.870
<b>Such gratitude.</b>

09:43.620 --> 09:44.790
<b>I'm...</b>

09:45.710 --> 09:46.670
<b>I...</b>

09:55.510 --> 09:57.800
<b>I see.</b>

09:57.800 --> 10:00.720
<b>You can be in sunlight
and not burn up?</b>

10:00.720 --> 10:05.810
<b>You truly are one of those
legendary Daywalkers, aren't you?</b>

10:06.770 --> 10:07.850
<b>I'm...</b>

10:07.850 --> 10:09.500
<b>human!</b>

10:14.110 --> 10:16.010
<b>Why'd you help me?</b>

10:16.820 --> 10:22.160
<b>I suppose I find it intriguing, the way you apologize
to your victims when you drink their blood.</b>

10:22.990 --> 10:24.660
<b>How do you know about that?</b>

10:24.660 --> 10:26.540
<b>You were talking in your sleep,</b>

10:27.410 --> 10:30.710
<b>and I happened to overhear it.</b>

10:32.130 --> 10:36.130
<b>I just can't control it
when I start to act like them.</b>

10:37.300 --> 10:41.470
<b>And I can't afford to die,
until I get what I'm after.</b>

10:42.510 --> 10:46.270
<b>What exactly are you after,
that you'd be willing to go so far?</b>

10:47.890 --> 10:52.310
<b>You ever hear about a vampire
with four fangs?</b>

10:52.760 --> 10:54.050
<b>No.</b>

10:54.050 --> 10:55.080
<b>I can't say I have.</b>

10:55.820 --> 10:58.240
<b>I'm looking for him.</b>

10:58.240 --> 11:00.550
<b>My Mom, he...</b>

11:03.620 --> 11:08.620
<b>There is one way you can suppress
your thirst for blood.</b>

11:10.210 --> 11:11.360
<b>Would you like to try it?</b>

11:14.750 --> 11:19.930
<b>There's a retro-virus that I isolated from
a vampire's ashes in this serum.</b>

11:21.430 --> 11:26.810
<b>I had experimented with trying to cure vampirism
in people who had been turned with this, but...</b>

11:26.810 --> 11:29.180
<b>it takes a long time to manufacture.</b>

11:29.890 --> 11:32.310
<b>This is currently all I have.</b>

11:33.900 --> 11:36.730
<b>Moreover, it was a failure as a cure.</b>

11:37.480 --> 11:45.450
<b>The idea was to have the retro-virus attack
the vampire virus on a genetic level, but...</b>

11:45.450 --> 11:48.750
<b>everyone I tested it on burnt up.</b>

11:50.000 --> 11:54.840
<b>But considering you were born this way,
with a unique strain of their characteristics,</b>

11:54.840 --> 11:59.010
<b>it may be able to suppress
your thirst for blood.</b>

11:59.590 --> 12:02.760
<b>This is just a hypothesis though,
and I offer no guarantees.</b>

12:03.430 --> 12:05.470
<b>Even though you are a Daywalker,</b>

12:05.470 --> 12:08.600
<b>there's a chance it could kill you
even if it doesn't turn you to ashes.</b>

12:16.570 --> 12:19.360
<b>You saved that woman.</b>

12:19.360 --> 12:20.340
<b>Why?</b>

12:22.780 --> 12:23.840
<b>What does it matter?</b>

12:24.740 --> 12:30.000
<b>If you were simply living for revenge,
you'd only need to kill vampires.</b>

12:30.000 --> 12:32.480
<b>There's no need to protect humans.</b>

12:34.580 --> 12:37.380
<b>You could have simply fed off humans,</b>

12:37.380 --> 12:40.420
<b>while continuing your search for
the man with four fangs.</b>

12:41.630 --> 12:45.220
<b>But, is that what you really want?</b>

12:46.180 --> 12:49.140
<b>If you're unable to get your revenge,</b>

12:49.140 --> 12:51.810
<b>what would you say to
the people you've hurt?</b>

12:51.810 --> 12:55.190
<b>Do you think your claims that you're
not like them would hold water?</b>

12:56.100 --> 12:58.650
<b>You may be turned to ashes,</b>

12:58.650 --> 13:01.570
<b>but you may also survive,
controlling your blood lust,</b>

13:01.570 --> 13:04.070
<b>and become something
greater than them.</b>

13:06.660 --> 13:08.580
<b>It's your choice.</b>

13:12.750 --> 13:13.410
<b>Do it.</b>

13:17.540 --> 13:18.670
<b>Let's begin...</b>

13:29.600 --> 13:30.800
<b>Listen to me.</b>

13:30.800 --> 13:33.640
<b>Right now you're
a parasite just like them.</b>

13:33.640 --> 13:39.150
<b>But you're a victim of the parasite yourself,
it's not your existence that's parasitic.</b>

13:39.860 --> 13:41.360
<b>Hold steadfast!</b>

13:41.360 --> 13:43.400
<b>If you truly wish to live as a human,</b>

13:43.400 --> 13:47.570
<b>overcome that pain,
and make a miracle happen!</b>

13:49.370 --> 13:50.330
<b>I will...</b>

13:50.330 --> 13:53.580
<b>hunt them as a human...</b>

13:53.580 --> 13:56.080
<b>and kill the four fanged vampire!</b>

14:02.750 --> 14:06.530
<b><i>This reminds me of
a story I heard once...</i></b>

14:07.800 --> 14:12.690
<b><i>about a Daywalker that
was born in London.</i></b>

14:16.350 --> 14:19.860
<b><i>I don't know if you're that boy.</i></b>

14:20.770 --> 14:26.120
<b><i>But if you are, it's impressive that you
survived this long, on your own.</i></b>

14:50.640 --> 14:52.700
<b>It seems I've got my miracle.</b>

15:02.480 --> 15:06.110
<b>Teach me how to fight them.</b>

15:07.240 --> 15:08.610
<b>I don't take apprentices.</b>

15:09.700 --> 15:13.370
<b>So, from now on
you're my partner, Eric.</b>

15:13.990 --> 15:15.370
<b>I hope you're ready.</b>

15:20.250 --> 15:24.250
<b>We've been traveling all over the world,
hunting vampires since then.</b>

15:25.050 --> 15:30.090
<b>Although it was a while before
people started calling him "Blade".</b>

15:31.090 --> 15:34.850
<b>That's got nothing to do with me.</b>

15:35.760 --> 15:37.140
<b>He...</b>

15:37.140 --> 15:38.640
<b>my Dad, he...</b>

15:41.520 --> 15:42.810
<b>Revenge, eh?</b>

15:46.780 --> 15:48.940
<b>Your father was a hunter as well?</b>

15:50.030 --> 15:51.110
<b>So what if he was?</b>

15:52.320 --> 15:53.780
<b>Well...</b>

15:53.780 --> 15:54.990
<b>never mind.</b>

15:55.870 --> 15:58.620
<b>You're running from
the darkness inside of you.</b>

15:59.620 --> 16:00.980
<b>The darkness in me?</b>

16:02.080 --> 16:07.630
<b>As Vampire hunters we fight not only the darkness
in others, but also that in ourselves.</b>

16:08.710 --> 16:12.590
<b>Eric has been fighting against the darkness
within him this entire time.</b>

16:13.430 --> 16:16.370
<b>Have you noticed that
old knife he carries around?</b>

16:16.810 --> 16:17.870
<b>Yeah.</b>

16:17.870 --> 16:20.680
<b>It seems like some kind of heirloom.</b>

16:20.680 --> 16:21.840
<b>I don't know the details.</b>

16:22.940 --> 16:31.400
<b>When I look at him, I can kind of understand
why he tries so hard to live life as a human.</b>

16:33.410 --> 16:36.370
<b>I've never asked him
what he's done.</b>

16:38.370 --> 16:41.710
<b>A hunter's duty isn't to hunt them.</b>

16:41.710 --> 16:44.250
<b>It's to protect people from them.</b>

16:45.290 --> 16:48.710
<b>If you kill him,
who exactly are you protecting?</b>

16:55.680 --> 16:56.760
<b>Oh my.</b>

16:56.760 --> 16:59.180
<b>The coffee's gone cold.</b>

16:59.180 --> 17:00.890
<b>Age doesn't suit me well.</b>

17:00.890 --> 17:03.270
<b>I tend to go on with these stories.</b>

17:04.270 --> 17:06.650
<b>Miss, how about it?</b>

17:06.650 --> 17:09.040
<b>My personal blend is quite excellent.</b>

17:09.690 --> 17:12.070
<b>Here now, don't be so bashful.</b>

17:16.870 --> 17:18.490
<b>Don't call me "miss."</b>

17:21.870 --> 17:23.710
<b>I've got a name,
and it's Makoto.</b>

17:26.830 --> 17:28.920
<b>Well, my apologies!</b>

17:28.920 --> 17:44.200
<b>You have to understand, I used
to be "young master" after all.</b>

17:42.390 --> 17:44.200
<b>H-Hey, what is that?</b>

17:44.640 --> 17:45.440
<b>What is it?</b>

17:45.440 --> 17:46.710
<b>What's the fuss?</b>

17:49.020 --> 17:50.210
<b>Mandurugos!</b>

17:50.210 --> 17:51.320
<b>What's a Mandurugo?</b>

17:52.110 --> 17:54.940
<b>A vampire from Filipino folklore.</b>

17:55.570 --> 17:58.530
<b>You should arm yourself well
if you don't want to die!</b>

17:58.530 --> 18:00.010
<b>They're all loaded with silver!</b>

18:03.080 --> 18:04.160
<b>Here they come!</b>

18:06.920 --> 18:10.500
<b>Rule number two,
no blood suckers on my boat!</b>

18:23.520 --> 18:24.470
<b>Dammit...</b>

18:41.280 --> 18:42.510
<b>I'm outta ammo!</b>

18:44.120 --> 18:45.040
<b>Shit!</b>

19:15.530 --> 19:18.440
<b>I am Matthes, from Existence.</b>

19:18.440 --> 19:22.320
<b>Blade, you won't reach
the Philippines alive.</b>

19:25.120 --> 19:26.160
<b>Wait!</b>

19:33.130 --> 19:35.000
<b>Blast it, now what do I do?</b>

19:38.590 --> 19:39.590
<b>Miss!</b>

19:39.590 --> 19:40.570
<b>I could use your help!</b>

19:42.720 --> 19:43.640
<b>But...</b>

19:45.720 --> 19:46.720
<b>Hey!</b>

19:46.720 --> 19:49.270
<b>Are you a vampire hunter or not!?</b>

20:14.420 --> 20:17.590
<b>Damn that little meddling brat.</b>

20:18.250 --> 20:20.070
<b>I'll end this now!</b>

20:20.670 --> 20:21.380
<b>Eric!</b>

20:25.390 --> 20:26.930
<b><i>What a waste of serum...</i></b>

20:27.310 --> 20:29.560
<b><i>having to use it to kill this thing.</i></b>

20:31.180 --> 20:33.390
<b>W-What is this!?</b>

20:33.980 --> 20:36.310
<b>Tastes different than how
humans usually do, doesn't it?</b>

20:40.530 --> 20:41.280
<b>Mistress Matthes!</b>

20:57.420 --> 20:59.000
<b>Well done.</b>

21:00.670 --> 21:01.510
<b>We got 'em!</b>

21:01.510 --> 21:02.220
<b>Yes!</b>

21:05.890 --> 21:08.550
<b>Noah!</b>

21:12.020 --> 21:13.230
<b>What do we do?</b>

21:14.230 --> 21:15.730
<b>We follow them.</b>

21:16.350 --> 21:17.730
<b>Follow them?</b>

21:21.360 --> 21:24.240
<b>Keep us headed South...</b>

21:24.240 --> 21:25.200
<b>to the Philippines.</b>

23:02.460 --> 23:07.070
<b>Well, being a mother
isn't so bad after all.</b>

23:10.550 --> 23:13.740
<b>I've been waiting for this
for a long time...</b>

23:14.100 --> 23:18.390
<b>Now we can go to him,
together...</b>

23:19.190 --> 23:19.940
<b>Something...</b>

23:21.020 --> 23:22.330
<b>Eric...</b>

23:22.330 --> 23:23.590
<b>Something's there!</b>

23:24.040 --> 23:24.830
<b>Carol!</b>

23:25.730 --> 23:31.110
<i><b>Childhood Days</b></i>

23:26.110 --> 23:29.240
<b>Next time on Blade: Childhood Days.</b>
